 only supported line, and security support for 3.6 ended on 2026-08-16.\",\n      \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n      \"dateModified\": \"2026-10-20\",\n      \"keywords\": [\n        \"end-of-life\",\n        \"container\",\n        \"high\"\n      ],\n      \"about\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Thing\",\n        \"name\": \"Traefik image release lines 3.6 and older are end-of-life\",\n        \"identifier\": \"pkg:docker/library/traefik\"\n      },\n      \"citation\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"CreativeWork\",\n          \"name\": \"Traefik release policy (vendor)\",\n          \"url\": \"https://doc.traefik.io/traefik/deprecation/releases\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"isBasedOn\": \"https://github.com/velella-sh/offing/blob/main/registry/container.json\",\n      \"publisher\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Offing\",\n        \"url\": \"https://velella.sh/offing\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://velella.sh/offing/rules/container.traefik.eol-3.6-and-older.html#faq\",\n      \"url\": \"https://velella.sh/offing/rules/container.traefik.eol-3.6-and-older.html\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What is the lifecycle status of pkg:docker/library/traefik?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"End of life as of 2026-08-16. Affected versions: vers:semver/\\u003c3.7.0. Source: Traefik release policy (vendor) (https://doc.traefik.io/traefik/deprecation/releases).\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What replaces pkg:docker/library/traefik?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"A traefik image on a supported release line\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How do I check pkg:docker/library/traefik?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Run offing check pkg:docker/library/traefik.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>","position":{"start":{"line":84,"column":1,"offset":3648},"end":{"line":154,"column":10,"offset":6307}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":155,"column":1,"offset":6308}}}}
